    {
      "id": 357,
      "type": "Note",
      "pos": [
        -396.82148452527156,
        482.7680936521097
      ],
      "size": [
        764.1826973636356,
        425.77917175223286
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 2,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "转换为3D盲盒风格 (Transform into 3d blindbox toy style)，\n\n转换为水彩画风格 (Transform into water coulour painting style)，\n\n\n修复文物的提示词需要问ai，让ai补充细节描述，例如：\nupscale to 8k and filled the missing details from below:\nExtreme macro photography, fine intaglio carving, delicate etched lines on feathers, eyes, and beak, precise groove directionality.\nMicroscopic tool marks, rotary abrasive wheel grooves, U-shaped and V-shaped carved trenches with varying depth, hand-polished surface texture.\nMacro view of drilled bore-hole interior, bi-conical drill offset step marks, faint concentric spiral striations.\nTranslucent jade material, subsurface scattering, antique mineral patina, layered iron-rust brown stains, sharp boundaries of chalky white calcification.\nWeathered antique finish, greasy luster, handled patina, micro-pitting, mellow glossy surface.\n\n增加文字：\nadd white text in hand written style at the center bottom position, text reads \"generated with Miaomiao Harem Anima12\"\n\n虫佬klein修图提示词：\n保持构图一致性不变，Transform the image to realistic photograph. add realistic details to the corrupted image. restore high frequence details from the corrupted image.\n 高清修复极致保真还原，以原图高精度线稿为唯一结构基准，严格锁定轮廓、形体、比例、透视与构图，结构绝对稳定无扭曲变形偏移；提取原图原生色彩基调、色相、明度、饱和度、光影冷暖及色彩分布，严格遵循原图色调与色彩逻辑不篡改；在线稿结构与色彩基调双重约束下极致高清重绘，还原微米级真实物理纹理、材质纤维、表皮肌理、凹凸质感、细腻光影层次与微细节，8K超高清，极致锐利对焦，像素级细节拉满，写实精致，无模糊噪点涂抹伪质感，仅保真修复不新增元素不二次创作完全忠于原图，\n\n转真人风格提示词：\ntransfer image and redraw the main character as a realistic young lady. Maintain the original pose but render with photographic textures (skin pores, fabric sheen, natural shadows). soft lighting.\n\ntransfer image and redraw the main character as a realistic young lady. Maintain the original pose but render with photographic textures. soft lighting. 网红颜值，淡妆，轻度美颜，\n\n转简约色块风格：\n提取画面主体，转绘成大色块手绘厚涂草稿，只保留主要色块，不要细节，不要勾勒线条，不要细节，不要五官，不要纹理，no outlines, no details, transfer into abstract color blocks\n\n\n\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
